Apply after seccomp-exec.patch, tenant-root.patch, runtime-log.patch, and
executable-permissions.patch. Not an upstream-reviewed backport.
Preserve configured-base attachment; only EBUSY permits a pinned strict init
descendant. Explicit subgroups/systemd/v1/default-relative paths are unchanged.
No group creation, controller changes, threaded conversion, or unrelated PID moves.

